2026-11-09T01:10:52.1069737Z -- v4.0.5 — DHW conservation: a cold tank cannot pour hot water
2026-11-09T01:10:52.1069861Z   ok   the booked draw never exceeds the nominal demand
2026-11-09T01:10:52.1070011Z   ok   every step balances: in == out + losses + storage delta
2026-11-09T01:10:52.1070237Z   ok   the inlet floor fabricated nothing — the scaled draw makes it inert
2026-11-09T01:10:52.1070399Z   ok   a cold tank delivers less than the nominal demand, not the same
