2026-11-09T01:10:52.1070704Z   ok   a tank at the setpoint is debited exactly the nominal draw
2026-11-09T01:10:52.1070870Z   ok   charging cannot pass the tank rating, and the excess is booked
2026-11-09T01:10:52.1071237Z   ok   a tank read above the rating cools at its physical rate, not by fiat
2026-11-09T01:10:52.1071420Z   ok   an inlet above the tank's surroundings manufactures no heat over 24 h
